  "content": "# 第33题\n\n**题型**: 选择题\n\n**难度**: ★★★☆☆\n\n**分值**: 2分\n\n---\n\n## 题目内容\n\n33. What can we learn from this passage？\n\n## 选项\n\nA. A. Those who do not go on river time will live an imbalanced life．\n\nB. B. New ways of measuring time can help to control Earth systems．\n\nC. C. Atomic time will get ahead of river time if the rivers run slower．\n\nD. D. Modern technology may help to shape the rivers’ temporal frame．\n\n---\n\n## 参考答案\n\nD\n\n",
  "answer": "B",
  "analysis": "本题考查介词。in+大地点；at+小地点；on+具体某天；by+方式。‘在车站’用at，故选B。"
}